<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-027" chapter-id="c-liangshu-027-xietiao-yinjun" source-id="s-liangshu-027-xietiao-yinjun-ws1511478">
  <p id="c-liangshu-027-xietiao-yinjun:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-027-xietiao-yinjun:p001:m0000" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e_A">殷鈞</persName>字季和，陳郡長平人也。晉太常融八世孫。父<persName id="c-liangshu-027-xietiao-yinjun:p001:m0022" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>，有才辯，知名齊世，歷官司徒從事中郎。<persName id="c-liangshu-027-xietiao-yinjun:p001:m0042" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>妻<persName id="c-liangshu-027-xietiao-yinjun:p001:m0044" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">王奐</persName>女。</p>
</text>
